  "outstanding": [
    "The degree-one prime in a given class is obtained from Chebotarev and the Hilbert class field. The local Jacobi divisibility and residue computations have their own passages. The odd-prime reflection inequality and the two-primary signature estimate enter the subsequent class-group bound separately."
